From: Jakub Zelenka <bukka@php.net>
Date: Tue, 4 Mar 2025 17:23:01 +0100
Subject: Fix GHSA-hrwm-9436-5mv3: pgsql escaping no error checks

This adds error checks for escape function is pgsql and pdo_pgsql
extensions. It prevents possibility of storing not properly escaped
data which could potentially lead to some security issues.

(cherry picked from commit 9376aeef9f8ff81f2705b8016237ec3e30bdee44)
(cherry picked from commit 7633d987cc11ee2601223e73cfdb8b31fed5980f)
(cherry picked from commit df2ecf34256c4a301e8959fe2eed0323f8b1b57a)
(cherry picked from commit 0a975f126905e0827c89f0cad34b4854c6a53a59)
(cherry picked from commit f4c78f613c40c6224fefca24bd9df02a21399620)
(cherry picked from commit 479f62e74e116acc48b4338c1453d32aeda87c42)
(cherry picked from commit c6ac611bc34ef00698e6a8b62b2337685ba34926)
